# Contoh Konfigurasi Google OAuth di .env

# Setelah mendapatkan credentials dari Google Cloud Console,
# tambahkan konfigurasi berikut ke file .env Anda:

# ===============================================
# GOOGLE OAUTH CONFIGURATION
# ===============================================

# Client ID dari Google Cloud Console
# Format: xxxxxxxxxxxxx-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx.apps.googleusercontent.com
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=your-google-client-id.apps.googleusercontent.com

# Client Secret dari Google Cloud Console
# Format: GOCSPX-xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=your-google-client-secret

# Redirect URI (harus sama dengan yang di Google Cloud Console)
# Development:
GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI=http://localhost:8000/auth/google/callback

# Production:
# GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI=https://yourdomain.com/auth/google/callback

# ===============================================
# CARA MENDAPATKAN CREDENTIALS
# ===============================================

# 1. Buka Google Cloud Console: https://console.cloud.google.com/
# 2. Pilih atau buat project
# 3. Aktifkan Google+ API
# 4. Pergi ke APIs & Services > Credentials
# 5. Klik "Create Credentials" > "OAuth client ID"
# 6. Pilih "Web application"
# 7. Tambahkan Authorized JavaScript origins:
#    - http://localhost:8000
#    - https://yourdomain.com (production)
# 8. Tambahkan Authorized redirect URIs:
#    - http://localhost:8000/auth/google/callback
#    - https://yourdomain.com/auth/google/callback (production)
# 9. Copy Client ID dan Client Secret
# 10. Paste ke file .env Anda

# ===============================================
# OAUTH CONSENT SCREEN
# ===============================================

# Jangan lupa konfigurasi OAuth Consent Screen:
# 1. App name: Bank Sampah Digital
# 2. User support email: your-email@example.com
# 3. Developer contact: your-email@example.com
# 4. Scopes yang dibutuhkan:
#    - .../auth/userinfo.email
#    - .../auth/userinfo.profile
# 5. Test users (jika mode Development/Testing)

# ===============================================
# PRODUCTION CHECKLIST
# ===============================================

# Untuk production, pastikan:
# ✅ Update GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI dengan domain production
# ✅ Tambahkan domain production ke Authorized origins
# ✅ Tambahkan redirect URI production ke Google Console
# ✅ Publish OAuth Consent Screen
# ✅ Gunakan HTTPS di production
# ✅ APP_ENV=production

